# Environment configuration — SAKSHYA (split per tier)
#
# Backend config lives in backend/.env.example (server, SQLite, CORS, ledger).
# Frontend config lives in frontend/.env.example (VITE_API_BASE_URL only).
#
# Rules enforced in this refactor:
#  - No demo passwords in frontend env / VITE_* variables (client-visible).
#  - No private keys, master keys, or backend secrets in the frontend.
#  - Backend secrets stay in backend/.env.example + backend/app/core/*.py.
#
# Offline demo defaults (no .env file needed at all):
#   Backend:  127.0.0.1:8100, SQLite at ./storage/sakshya.db
#   Frontend: http://127.0.0.1:8100/api (dev) or /api via nginx (Docker)
